<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed Thursday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 579.25, up 1.38.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 263 to 260.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,552,570, compared with 20,649,230 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
